n we called they were rude as well as when we went to pick up the order. I noticed the guy was eating when we were walking out, so he may have been annoyed he was interrupted and had to work."},{"business_id":"2Z7oHhFWBGuzusEF3j2dsA","review_id":"12KdyB7a1CK330gp796LfA","date":"2021-02-20T18:58:50","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9156153202056885,"text_excerpt":"Fiery crab was amazing as usual. My boil bag was fixed exactly how I ordered it and the sauce was on point! I called in my order and once I arrived, it was hot and ready!"},{"business_id":"2Z7oHhFWBGuzusEF3j2dsA","review_id":"pLJcDru7RmWDhGDvpZA7Ig","date":"2021-05-13T03:40:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9154649972915649,"text_excerpt":"First day walking through Nola, we asked a local where we could find a good seafood place and was directed to this place. It did not disappoint. The energy from the staff was refreshing and so welcoming. The food was so flavorful! I ordered the catfish po boy with seasoned fries. It was so much food. I was able to save some for later. This is a must visit location while you are in Nola. Great service and food. I would definitely go back whenever I am in Nola."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"2Z7oHhFWBGuzusEF3j2dsA","photo_id":"zJ15HoROEv8ZPj9Pmcs5DQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/zJ15HoROEv8ZPj9Pmcs5DQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9293157458305359},{"business_id":"2Z7oHhFWBGuzusEF3j2dsA","photo_id":"Iqlp5DNtC2vqQLvClU3cFw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Iqlp5DNtC2vqQLvClU3cFw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9090278148651123},{"business_id":"2Z7oHhFWBGuzusEF3j2dsA","photo_id":"5StD6x-_rxoFeajdd01Tsw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/5StD6x-_rxoFeajdd01Tsw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8771548271179199}]},"notebook_case":null}
